      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Datadog**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Datadog as the external provider. My plan is to make the provider easily identifiable within the `aggregate_metric_stats.py` file. Next, I need to outline how the Datadog client will be instantiated and configured.\n\n\n**Defining Implementation Steps**\n\nI'm now outlining the implementation steps. The main file will be `aggregate_metric_stats.py`, which will use the Datadog API client. The focus is to make the external provider, Datadog, easily identifiable. I plan to define a function to fetch the data and then start writing the contents of the file.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789861148646,
          "start": 1789861145119
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc09aa1f0010baLmp0lysDUL5",
